    "text": "The stream of a river is flowing with a speed of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>. A swimmer can swim at a speed of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi>km</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>. The direction of the swimmer with respect to the flow of the river, to cross the river straight, is",
